ords&quot;:[&quot;ENDLESS MULTITUDE&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-teeming-masses">TEEMING MASSES</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ENDLESS MULTITUDE unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-unending-waves" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ENDLESS MULTITUDE&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;unit-just-destroyed&quot;,&quot;once-per-battle&quot;,&quot;attached-characters-not-returned&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-unending-waves">UNENDING WAVES</button></h3></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Any phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ENDLESS MULTITUDE unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>Any destroyed CHARACTER units that were attached to your unit are not returned. You can only use this Stratagem once per battle.</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-adrenalised-onslaught" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;,&quot;unit-malanthrope&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-adrenalised-onslaught">Adrenalised Onslaught</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">TYRANIDS model only. Each time the bearer’s unit Piles In or Consolidates, models in this unit can move an additional 3&quot;.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-naturalised-camoflage" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;,&quot;unit-malanthrope&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 30 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-naturalised-camouflage">Naturalised Camouflage</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">TYRANIDS model only. At the start of the first battle round, select up to three friendly ENDLESS MULTITUDE units within 9&quot; of the bearer. Until the end of the battle round, each time a ranged attack targets one of those units, models in that unit have the Benefit of Cover against that attack.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-piercing-talons" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;,&quot;unit-malanthrope&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-piercing-talons">Piercing Talons</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">TYRANIDS model only. Each time a model in the bearer’s unit makes an attack, on a Critical Wound, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-relentless-hunger" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;,&quot;unit-malanthrope&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-relentless-hunger">Relentless Hunger</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">TYRANIDS model only. Add 2&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in the bearer’s unit.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="vanguard-onslaught" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Vanguard Onslaught</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-assassin-beasts" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;VANGUARD INVADER&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;not-selected-to-fight&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-assassin-beasts">ASSASSIN BEASTS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One VANGUARD INVADER INFANTRY unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [PRECISION] ability.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-hypersensory-scillia" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:2,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;alternatives&quot;:[{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;VANGUARD INVADER&quot;]},{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;TYRANIDS&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;within-8-of-enemy-unit-that-just-ended-move&quot;,&quot;not-within-engagement-range&quot;,&quot;up-to-two-targets-only-if-vanguard-invader&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-hypersensory-scillia">HYPERSENSORY SCILLIA</button></h3></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>Up to two VANGUARD INVADER units from your army that are within 8&quot; of that enemy unit, or one other TYRANIDS INFANTRY unit from your army that is within 8&quot; of that enemy unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Those selected units can each make a Normal move of up to 6&quot;.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>You cannot target units that are within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-invisible-hunter" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:2,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;alternatives&quot;:[{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;VANGUARD INVADER&quot;]},{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;TYRANIDS&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;more-than-3-from-all-enemy-units&quot;,&quot;up-to-two-targets-only-if-vanguard-invader&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-invisible-hunter">INVISIBLE HUNTER</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>End of your opponent’s Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>Up to two VANGUARD INVADER units from your army, or one TYRANIDS INFANTRY unit from your army.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Remove the targeted units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>The targeted units must be more than 3&quot; away from all enemy units.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-seeded-broods" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:2,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;TYRANIDS&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;unit-in-reserves&quot;,&quot;up-to-two-targets-only-if-vanguard-invader&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-seeded-broods">SEEDED BROODS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One TYRANIDS unit from your army that is in Reserves, or up to two VANGUARD INVADER units from your army that are in Reserves.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, for the purposes of setting up those selected units on the battlefield, treat the current battle round number as being one higher than it actually is.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-surprise-assault" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;VANGUARD INVADER&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;unit-just-selected-targets&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-surprise-assault">SURPRISE ASSAULT</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after a VANGUARD INVADER unit from your army has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That VANGUARD INVADER unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Select one enemy unit that was selected as the target of one or more of your unit’s attacks. That enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll. If the Battle-shock test was failed, add 1 to the Wound roll as well.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-unseen-lurkers" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;VANGUARD INVADER&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-ranged-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-unseen-lurkers">UNSEEN LURKERS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One VANGUARD INVADER unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18&quot; or, if your unit has the Lone Operative ability, if the attacking model is within 6&quot;. Your opponent can select new targets for the attacking unit’s attacks.</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-chameleonic" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-chameleonic">Chameleonic</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">VANGUARD INVADER model only. This unit has Stealth.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-hunting-grounds" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;,&quot;unit-malanthrope&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 30 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-hunting-grounds">Hunting Grounds</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">TYRANIDS model only. While the bearer is on the battlefield, each time your opponent sets up a Reserves unit on the battlefield, roll one D6: on a 2+, that unit must take a Battle-shock test.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-neuronode" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;,&quot;unit-malanthrope&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-neuronode">Neuronode</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">TYRANIDS model only. After both players have deployed their armies, you can select up to three VANGUARD INVADER units from your army and redeploy all of those units. When doing so, any of those units can be placed into Strategic Reserves, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-stalker" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-stalker">Stalker</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">VANGUARD INVADER model only. At the start of the battle, select one enemy unit. Each time the bearer makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll and add 1 to the Wound roll.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="warrior-bioform-onslaught" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Warrior Bioform Onslaught</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="alien-physiology" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-tyranid-warriors-with-melee-bio-weapons&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-warriors-with-ranged-bio-weapons&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-alien-physiology">Alien Physiology</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly TYRANID WARRIORS unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That TYRANID WARRIORS unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Attacks that target your unit with a S greater than your unit’s T have -1 to wound rolls.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="synaptic-micronodes" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-tyranid-warriors-with-melee-bio-weapons&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-warriors-with-ranged-bio-weapons&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;unit-destroyed-enemy-unit&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-synaptic-micronodes">Synaptic Micronodes</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>End of your Movement phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One friendly TYRANID WARRIORS unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Select one objective your unit is controlling. That objective is secured.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="parasitic-payload" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-tyranid-warriors-with-melee-bio-weapons&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-warriors-with-ranged-bio-weapons&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;selected-to-shoot&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-parasitic-payload">Parasitic Payload</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase, when a friendly TYRANID WARRIORS unit is selected to shoot.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That TYRANID WARRIORS unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit’s ranged attacks have [IGNORE COVER].</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="elevated-might" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 30 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-elevated-might">Elevated Might</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">WINGED TYRANID PRIME/TYRANID PRIME WITH LASH WHIP model only. This model’s melee attacks can re-roll wound rolls and have +1 AP.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="ocular-adaptation" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-ocular-adaptation">Ocular Adaptation</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">WINGED TYRANID PRIME/TYRANID PRIME WITH LASH WHIP model only. This unit’s melee attacks have +1 to hit rolls.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment related-core" data-detachment="core">
      <h2>Core Stratagems</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="content-group" id="core-stratagems" data-track="core-stratagems">
<h3 class="category-title">Core Stratagems</h3>
<p class="lead">Universal Stratagems available to every army. Datasheet tools only show the cards the selected unit can legally target.</p>
<div class="detachment-content stratagem-grid core-stratagem-grid">
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-command-re-roll" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>COMMAND RE-ROLL</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Any phase, just after you make an Advance, Charge, Damage, Hazard, Hit, Save or Wound roll for a unit from your army, or a roll to determine the number of attacks made with a weapon equipped by a model in that unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That unit or model from your army.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Re-roll that roll. If several dice were rolled, select one of them to re-roll; Charge rolls are re-rolled in full.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-epic-challenge" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>EPIC CHALLENGE</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Fight phase, just after a friendly CHARACTER unit is selected to fight.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That CHARACTER unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Select one CHARACTER model in that unit. Until the end of the phase, its melee weapons have the PRECISION ability.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-insane-bravery" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="core-rule-15-04-insane-bravery" data-term-title="INSANE BRAVERY" data-term-summary="1CP Core Stratagem Indifferent to their own survival, these warriors hold their ground against seemingly impossible odds. WHEN: Battle-shock step of your Command phase, just before you make a battle-shock roll for a friendly unit. TARGET: That unit. EFFECT: That battle-shock roll is automatically successful. RESTRICTIONS: You cannot use this stratagem more than once per battle." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/stratagems.html#rule-15-04" data-term-title="INSANE BRAVERY" data-term-summary="1CP Core Stratagem Indifferent to their own survival, these warriors hold their ground against seemingly impossible odds. WHEN: Battle-shock step of your Command phase, just before you make a battle-shock roll for a friendly unit. TARGET: That unit. EFFECT: That battle-shock roll is automatically successful. RESTRICTIONS: You cannot use this stratagem more than once per battle." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/stratagems.html#rule-15-04">INSANE BRAVERY</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Battle-shock step of your Command phase, just before a unit from your army takes a Battle-shock test.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>That test is automatically successful.</p>
<p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>RESTRICTIONS</b><br>Once per battle.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-explosives" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;EXPLOSIVES&quot;,&quot;GRENADES&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>EXPLOSIVES</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One EXPLOSIVES or GRENADES unit from your army that is eligible to shoot, did not Advance this turn and is not within Engagement Range of enemy units.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Select one eligible model, then one visible enemy unit within 8&quot; and outside Engagement Range. Roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-crushing-impact" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;MONSTER&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>CRUSHING IMPACT</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Your Charge phase, just after a MONSTER or VEHICLE unit from your army ends a Charge move.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That MONSTER or VEHICLE unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range and one model in your unit within Engagement Range of it. Roll a number of D6 equal to that model’s Toughness: each 1 inflicts 1 mortal wound on your unit; each 5+ inflicts 1 mortal wound on the enemy unit, to a maximum of 6.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-rapid-ingress" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;AIRCRAFT&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="core-rule-15-07-rapid-ingress" data-term-title="RAPID INGRESS" data-term-summary="1CP Core Stratagem Be it cunning strategy, potent technology or supernatural ritual, there are many means by which a commander may hasten their warriors’ onset. WHEN: End of your opponent’s Movement phase. TARGET: One friendly unit that is in strategic reserves (excluding AIRCRAFT). EFFECT: Your unit makes an ingress move. RESTRICTIONS: You cannot use this stratagem during the first battle round." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/stratagems.html#rule-15-07" data-term-title="RAPID INGRESS" data-term-summary="1CP Core Stratagem Be it cunning strategy, potent technology or supernatural ritual, there are many means by which a commander may hasten their warriors’ onset. WHEN: End of your opponent’s Movement phase. TARGET: One friendly unit that is in strategic reserves (excluding AIRCRAFT). EFFECT: Your unit makes an ingress move. RESTRICTIONS: You cannot use this stratagem during the first battle round." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/stratagems.html#rule-15-07">RAPID INGRESS</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>End of your opponent’s Movement phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army in Strategic Reserves, excluding AIRCRAFT.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>That unit can make an ingress move.</p>
<p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>RESTRICTIONS</b><br>Cannot be used during the first battle round.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-fire-overwatch" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;TITANIC&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>FIRE OVERWATCH</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>End of your opponent’s Movement phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army, excluding TITANIC units, that is not within Engagement Range of enemy units.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Your unit can shoot one visible enemy unit within 24&quot; using Snap Shooting: only unmodified Hit rolls of 6 score a hit and Hit rolls cannot be re-rolled. After it has shot, that unit is not eligible to perform an Action this turn.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-smokescreen" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SMOKE&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>SMOKESCREEN</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Start of your opponent’s Shooting phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One SMOKE unit from your army.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Until the end of the phase, that unit has the Benefit of Cover. In addition, a friendly unit not fully visible to the attacking unit because it is obscured by the selected SMOKE unit also has the Benefit of Cover against that attack.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-heroic-intervention" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]},{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;VEHICLE&quot;],&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;WALKER&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>HEROIC INTERVENTION</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>End of your opponent’s Charge phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army within 12&quot; of one or more enemy units and not within Engagement Range. A VEHICLE can only be targeted if it is also a CHARACTER or WALKER.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Resolve a Charge and select one mode before the Charge roll. <b>Leap to Defend:</b> charge targets must have made a Charge move this phase and be within the maximum distance. <b>Into the Fray (+1CP):</b> if the modified Charge roll is greater than 6, change it to 6; charge targets can be any enemy units within 6&quot; and within the maximum distance.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-counteroffensive" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>COUNTEROFFENSIVE</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Your opponent’s Fight step, just after an enemy unit has resolved its attacks.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army that is eligible to fight.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Your unit has Fights First and must be the next unit selected to fight.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section></div>
    </section>
